==Strategy==
You can swarm this stage relatively easily using [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]], [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Mystic Uril]], and [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]]. Simply save up enough money to spawn Mystic Uril, then just start spamming Royal Guard Cats while running [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]] for more consistency. They should take care of the Oldhorn quickly enough before moving on to Othom and obliterating him just as quickly. There's hardly any frontline pressure beyond this point, so just keep spamming Royal Guard Cats until you eventually beat the stage.

==Trivia==
*According to its Japanese name, Silver Current refers to a current of water. Since it comes before [[Ultima Beast Naala]], who may represent [[wikipedia:Eikþyrnir|Eikþyrnir]] from Norse mythology, Silver Current could refer to the rivers created from the dew that drips from Eikþyrnir's glowing antlers into [[wikipedia:Hvergelmir|Hvergelmir]].

